\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Golden</b> <b>Enoki Mushroom</b> can be found in the same cave as <a href=\"/wiki/Sapphire\" title=\"Sapphire\">Sapphire</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>. It sells for $560 raw and $1,400 in a dye jar. \n</p><p>It's a significantly rarer version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Enoki_Mushroom\" title=\"Enoki Mushroom\">Enoki Mushroom</a>.\n</p><p>When this, Enoki Mushroom, and Snowdrop were first added, they all gave the same dye as Silver Brunia. \n</p><p>Like all other fruits and flowers, you can simply put this into a press with a jar to make it into dye, increasing the price from $560 to $1,400.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903025507\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019514/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.399      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.399      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3706-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903025507 and revision id 18826. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Fruits"],"links":[{"title":"Snowlands","exists":true},{"title":"Version 1.71.0","exists":true},{"title":"Enoki Mushroom","exists":true},{"title":"Sapphire","exists":true}],"images":["GoldenEnokiMushroom.png"]}
